      "content": "thanks, that phrasing helps a lot. i just want to make sure i'm not being too vague. i've been hearing people talk about how \"noise\" in the data can really mess things up and make these errors happen. is there a technical way to explain that \"noise\" aspect specifically? like, why do these inconsistencies happen in the first place during data collection?",
